# Field Mapping Between SaleBO and Listing GraphQL

## Overview

This reference maps SaleBO fields to their corresponding SVLS GraphQL fields for the ULP migration. Each entry identifies the source field, its GraphQL equivalent, its purpose, and any processing guidance or related SaleBO fields.

!!! note
    Some mappings require additional logical processing or data conversion. Consult the implementation notes in the **SVLS GraphQL Field Comments** column when present.

Use the page search to find a SaleBO method, flag, or GraphQL field quickly.

